  "label": "Farm Equipment Metaphor",
  "description": "The phrase 'farm equipment overheats' is a metaphor for machinery that breaks down and requires maintenance. In the meme, this metaphor is applied to Black people, suggesting they are broken, in need of constant repair, and only useful when functioning as tools.",
